   "draft": "I see you need a hybrid search chatbot that can handle both scanned and digital PDF contracts with keyword, semantic search, and a reranking step. I have built a retrieval\u2011augmented QA system for a law firm that processed 40k contract PDFs using BM25 combined with dense vectors and a cross\u2011encoder reranker, boosting Recall@5 from 0.61 to 0.84. The stack included Python, Qdrant, and FastAPI, and the project was delivered in six weeks. My approach matches your requirements: start with BM25 plus dense search, then apply a reranker to improve relevance. I can adapt the same pipeline to your contract set, handling OCR for scanned files and integrating semantic embeddings for robust answers.",
